      "quote": "CORRECTION: the record read 2025-05-06 and the town's own warrant says otherwise -- \"WARRANT - 2025 Town Election / Tuesday the 29th day of April, 2025 / at 9:00 a.m. until 8:00 p.m.\" (a scan, read at 250 dpi). The results sheet prints only \"ELECTION RESULTS - 2025 TOWN ELECTION\" and is footed \"2025 Town Election Results\", with no day anywhere. Ashburnham votes the last Tuesday in April in every other published year (2021-04-27, 2022-04-26, 2023-04-25, 2024-04-30, 2026-04-28); 2025-05-06 was the lone outlier.",
